{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach it, otherwise bypass obstacle. Grab, check properties, move and do task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = BypassObstacleToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestiny    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectBehindObstacle    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
